1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,184
A B.

2
00:00:01,184 --> 00:00:10,598
The mother can give only little i, so every child gets an i: either I A little i, group A, or I B little i, group B.

3
00:00:10,598 --> 00:00:16,158
An A B child would need both I A and I B, and the mother can supply neither.

4
00:00:16,158 --> 00:00:21,445
A and B both is the trap: those are exactly the groups that can appear.

